WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.045
If you were stuck in horrifying financial ruin,
what would you do?

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:05.505
The only way to escape

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:10.635
crippling debt is to risk your life
playing twisted games with brutal punishments.

00:00:10.635 --> 00:00:13.013
I'm here to break down the mistakes made.

00:00:13.054 --> 00:00:17.809
What You Should Do
and How to beat the DEBT GAMES in Tomodachi Game.

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:22.439
This honest kid is about to find out
that hard work doesn't pay off.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.440
Yuichi here works

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:28.945
tirelessly for a delivery company and other part
time jobs to pay for his school trip.

00:00:28.945 --> 00:00:32.615
And he finally makes enough cash
to go on his dream trip.

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:36.036
However, he's going to soon
realized that it was all for nothing.

00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:40.206
The next day, the principal announces
that ¥2 million that they all collected

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.375
for their school trip has been stolen.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:45.879
Black haired girl Shiho begs for forgiveness
for losing the money,

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:49.758
telling the class that someone had taken it
from her locker, that night.

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:54.888
Yuichi receives a letter from Shiho telling him
to meet her outside of school as soon as possible.

00:00:54.929 --> 00:00:57.807
That's when he arrives at the entrance,
seeing all of his friends

00:00:57.807 --> 00:01:02.395
waiting for him to fess up and tell them why
he sent them all the same creepy letter

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:04.397
asking them to meet up with him.

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:09.402
The group realizes that someone else,
not Yuichi sent them all the same letter.

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:12.197
Suddenly the group is attacked and they black out.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:17.619
They wake up in a clear white room, only to be
greeted by this creepy looking mascot, Manabu.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.454
He tells the group that they've been entered

00:01:19.454 --> 00:01:24.167
into a series of games
each game giving them ¥2 million if they win.

00:01:24.209 --> 00:01:25.668
However, there's a catch.

00:01:25.668 --> 00:01:29.589
One of them has ¥20 million in debt.
That must be paid off.

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:34.844
This glasses guy, Tenji approaches the mascot
and accuses him of illegally kidnaping them.

00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:36.846
But Manabu has a trick up his sleeve.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:41.768
He tells them that someone already paid
for the entry fee of ¥2 million,

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:45.063
the exact same amount
that was stolen for the school trip.

00:01:45.063 --> 00:01:47.982
However, he gives them the option to quit
if they want to.

00:01:47.982 --> 00:01:51.402
But whoever leaves
has to pay the debt off by themselves.

00:03:09.314 --> 00:03:09.814
Okay.

00:03:09.814 --> 00:03:13.401
This is clearly one of the most illegal things
I have ever witnessed.

00:03:13.401 --> 00:03:16.154
A group of high school
students have just been blackmailed.

00:03:16.154 --> 00:03:19.532
Kidnapped and told 
that one of them has ¥20 million in debt.

00:03:19.574 --> 00:03:22.243
Now, there's a lot of different ways
to handle this situation.

00:03:22.243 --> 00:03:24.871
And I say becoming violent
seems like the easiest one.

00:03:24.913 --> 00:03:28.666
If I were these students, I would beat the ever
living crap out of Manabu here.

00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:32.712
This serves to purposes
one we get revenge on him or whoever he works for

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:36.883
and potentially beating him down hard enough
that he'll confess who the debt belongs to.

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:40.345
However, in reality, that is a terrible idea.
What we really need to do

00:03:40.345 --> 00:03:44.766
is to put on our Sherlock
and figure out who has the ¥20 million in debt.

00:03:44.807 --> 00:03:46.184
The phrase whoever smelted

00:03:46.184 --> 00:03:50.813
delt it. might be a good idea that we can use
to narrow down our list of suspects.

00:03:50.813 --> 00:03:56.236
And at the top of my list is black haired girl
and this glasses guy Tenji with his glasses.

00:03:56.277 --> 00:03:58.029
Dudes with glasses are always

00:03:58.029 --> 00:04:02.533
the mysterious blokes, but this black haired girl
might just be one of those innocent types

00:04:02.533 --> 00:04:05.578
that has a mysterious dark side
when shit hits the fan

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:07.914
and we already know the deal with this dude.

00:04:07.956 --> 00:04:11.501
This kid's got some glasses guy energy
about him.

00:04:11.501 --> 00:04:16.005
And according to past enemies, the dudes with
glasses are usually bona fide perverts.

00:04:16.005 --> 00:04:19.592
Am I right? However,
I wouldn't try ganging up on him just yet.

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:21.552
I would use some psychological trickery

00:04:21.552 --> 00:04:26.224
and over time make them spit their dirty
little secrets right into our ear holes.

00:04:26.224 --> 00:04:30.311
Manabu introduces them to a fake classroom
and gives them name tags

00:04:30.311 --> 00:04:31.896
with a number on the other side.

00:04:31.896 --> 00:04:36.943
Each one shows them the 4 million debt they owe,
and if they clear the game, they'll be debt free.

00:04:36.985 --> 00:04:39.487
However,
they're not allowed to show the amount of debt

00:04:39.487 --> 00:04:42.323
or speak to other people during Question Time.

00:04:42.323 --> 00:04:45.451
If they do,
the participants will have their fine doubled.

00:04:45.493 --> 00:04:50.331
Manabu shows them a demonstration of what happens
when they all give the same correct answer.

00:04:50.331 --> 00:04:54.460
They must work together, or else one of them
will be given a massive debt to pay.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:59.340
The mascot then gives them their first question
Is the tallest mountain in Japan, Mt. FUJI?

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:02.969
Suddenly the coin moves to no
and they fail the first round.

00:05:03.011 --> 00:05:08.850
The second question is given, as does one plus one
equal two, and the coin moves to the wrong side

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:10.351
and they fail once again.

00:05:10.351 --> 00:05:15.815
The third question is read out by Tenji, who asks,
Is their country called Japan in English?

00:05:15.857 --> 00:05:20.236
The students fail a third time to answer
correctly, and Yuichi here begins to grow

00:05:20.236 --> 00:05:25.533
paranoid that someone is sabotaging the game
on purpose with only two questions remaining.

00:05:25.533 --> 00:05:27.201
They continue to get the questions wrong.

00:05:27.201 --> 00:05:29.787
And then the final part of Game one begins.

00:05:29.829 --> 00:05:32.498
The shy girl her has given the final question.

00:05:32.498 --> 00:05:35.001
She asks the group, Will we always be friends?

00:05:35.043 --> 00:05:39.505
But before everybody can put their finger down
on the coin and answer, Yuichi speaks out and

00:05:39.505 --> 00:05:44.761
asks a rather naughty question and is penalized
by having his debt increased two fold.

00:05:44.802 --> 00:05:47.847
He tells the group that the answer is simple
Just say yes.

00:05:47.889 --> 00:05:50.558
The students make up their mind
and answer the final question

00:05:50.558 --> 00:05:52.602
by moving the coin on to the correct answer.

00:05:52.643 --> 00:05:55.229
The group has successfully cleared
the game and wins

00:05:55.229 --> 00:05:59.859
¥2 million, but Yuichi here is trapped
and in even more debt than before.

00:05:59.859 --> 00:06:01.778
After the game, Yuichi and the black haired

00:06:01.778 --> 00:06:04.655
girl, Shiho, have a conversation
about who the traitor is.

00:06:04.655 --> 00:06:08.409
He accuses her of stealing the money,
but she denies having any involvement

00:06:08.409 --> 00:06:10.286
with what happened and with this game.

00:06:10.286 --> 00:06:12.622
Okay, that was extremely close.

00:06:12.622 --> 00:06:17.001
Things could have gone wrong so quick,
and somebody in this group has betrayed us.

00:06:17.001 --> 00:06:18.669
It could be one of them or all of them.

00:06:18.669 --> 00:06:20.963
The questions were given to test our knowledge.

00:06:20.963 --> 00:06:23.466
They were given to us to test our friendship.

00:06:23.466 --> 00:06:28.513
Getting into this situation was bad enough, but
purposely trying to sabotage the group's success.

00:06:28.513 --> 00:06:31.516
Well, I mean, somebody here is pretty dang evil.

00:06:31.516 --> 00:06:33.476
While we might not be able to catch the traitor

00:06:33.476 --> 00:06:38.106
this time around, we should be on the lookout
for telltale signs of a liar in the next game.

00:06:38.147 --> 00:06:40.817
Now, things such as eye twitches and looking away

00:06:40.817 --> 00:06:46.114
when speaking shouldn't be used as 100%
concrete proof that someone is lying.

00:06:46.155 --> 00:06:50.618
These aren't the facts, and there's going to be
a strong punishment for whoever the traitor is.

00:06:50.618 --> 00:06:52.620
So we better get it right the first time.

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:56.958
The only way to properly determine
if something is a lie is through inconsistency.

00:06:56.958 --> 00:07:00.128
The two most suspicious people are Shiho and Shibe,

00:07:00.128 --> 00:07:03.047
both of them announced that the classes’ money was missing.

00:07:03.089 --> 00:07:06.843
However, that isn't a sure
fire way to narrow down our list of suspects.

00:07:06.884 --> 00:07:07.844
It is a start, though.

00:07:07.844 --> 00:07:12.765
If I was Yuichi, I'd be recalling every single
interaction I've ever had with my classmates

00:07:12.765 --> 00:07:15.977
from the very start of our Friendship
two before the game started.

00:07:15.977 --> 00:07:18.438
We should be looking out for any moments
where our friends

00:07:18.438 --> 00:07:21.399
might have backstabbed us
or done something suspicious.

00:07:21.399 --> 00:07:23.901
It might sound like a stretch right now,
but with this

00:07:23.901 --> 00:07:26.487
we should be able to clue in
to a potential suspect

00:07:26.487 --> 00:07:29.991
as long as we're sure of whatever past memory
we can conjure up.

00:07:30.032 --> 00:07:32.410
The students are sent to a roof for the next game.

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:37.790
Professor Manabu now introduces Game
two by the name of Bad Mouth Sugar Roku.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:43.004
Each participant must go into a booth and write
a bad mouth confession about another participant.

00:07:43.045 --> 00:07:44.964
Once the messages have been set, viewers

00:07:44.964 --> 00:07:49.802
watching from the sky will rate which confession
is the worst in order from first to last.

00:07:49.844 --> 00:07:52.805
The ranked confessions will determine
how many spaces they move

00:07:52.805 --> 00:07:55.057
down the ladder from one space to five.

00:07:55.057 --> 00:08:01.105
The first to reach the end will suffer a massive
loss, but in doing so will give everyone ¥400,000

00:08:01.105 --> 00:08:05.818
and reward anyone left on the board
will be given an extra ¥1 million in debt,

00:08:05.818 --> 00:08:10.406
but then they have the option to be able
to go home for a bit and skip the third game.

00:08:10.448 --> 00:08:13.493
If no one puts down a confession
and leaves the card blank.

00:08:13.534 --> 00:08:15.912
Everyone will move down one space together.

00:08:15.912 --> 00:08:18.915
And if they keep repeating the process
of skipping the questions,

00:08:18.915 --> 00:08:24.212
they will all be able to clear the game
in one piece with a combined ¥2 million in reward.

00:08:24.212 --> 00:08:27.965
But if they make that choice,
then they have to play the third game.

00:08:27.965 --> 00:08:30.635
Okay, now that we've experienced the glories

00:08:30.635 --> 00:08:35.181
of the first game, we need to prepare
for any kind of weird crap that could happen next.

00:08:35.181 --> 00:08:37.934
If we really think about it
and break down the game one,

00:08:37.975 --> 00:08:41.270
there seems to be an element of trust
that is recurring throughout now.

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:43.314
There
there's always the possibility that whoever stole

00:08:43.314 --> 00:08:46.275
the money is in cahoots with this money
sucking game.

00:08:46.317 --> 00:08:49.111
I'd be weighing my options out and assessing
what's easier.

00:08:49.111 --> 00:08:53.616
Win the game and move on to a third game
or take an increased amount of debt and be free.

00:08:53.658 --> 00:08:55.826
If I was Yuichi, the more tempting option

00:08:55.826 --> 00:08:58.955
would be to just take on more debt
and lose the game on purpose.

00:08:58.996 --> 00:09:03.501
There's no reason to stick around, and no one can
stop us from leaving this place once and for all.

00:09:03.834 --> 00:09:05.795
Winning this game and moving on to the next.

00:09:05.795 --> 00:09:08.339
Looks like it involves jumping off of a building.

00:09:08.381 --> 00:09:11.133
I don't know about you,
but that does not look like a good time to me.

00:09:11.133 --> 00:09:12.468
Other than attacking Manabu,

00:09:12.468 --> 00:09:15.638
however, there's only one other option
that doesn't involve playing the game.

00:09:15.638 --> 00:09:17.431
We could just take a look around

00:09:17.431 --> 00:09:20.184
and see if there's any way
that we can get back down this building,

00:09:20.184 --> 00:09:22.270
assuming this building is in fact

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:27.275
actually a building and not just some set
that someone cooked up for our sick, twisted game.

00:09:27.316 --> 00:09:28.859
If the building is real, there's

00:09:28.859 --> 00:09:33.364
many ways to safely descend down a building,
and it requires more brains than brawn.

00:09:33.406 --> 00:09:36.742
The chain link fence is a perfect starting point
to begin the descent.

00:09:36.742 --> 00:09:39.704
If this is a real building,
they will only have to climb down

00:09:39.704 --> 00:09:41.956
a small bit to get down to the next window.

00:09:41.956 --> 00:09:43.958
And from then we could try to force our way in

00:09:43.958 --> 00:09:47.712
and make our way down to the ground floor
and get away from this game for good.

00:09:47.712 --> 00:09:52.258
The first confessions are given out
and the group manages to work together as a team,

00:09:52.258 --> 00:09:53.968
moving only one space.

00:09:53.968 --> 00:09:59.098
Suddenly, a message appears above them, stating
that they've been penalized ¥100,000.

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:03.853
They're shocked and Manabu reveals that
a different penalty is attached with each space.

00:10:03.853 --> 00:10:07.607
And that's when someone puts down a confession
in the next round.

00:10:07.607 --> 00:10:09.567
Let the mind games begin.

00:10:09.567 --> 00:10:13.654
Shiho moves down five spaces
while the others stay put and the next round.

00:10:13.654 --> 00:10:17.617
Three confessions are given out with the black
haired girl taking the lead once again.

00:10:17.617 --> 00:10:20.578
The next round is set
and the confession is given out.

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:21.162
Shy Girl.

00:10:21.162 --> 00:10:24.999
Yutori is mortified
and is given 100% of the viewer's vote.

00:10:25.041 --> 00:10:29.712
Manabu reminds the group that whoever reaches
the goal first will take on everyone else's debt.

00:10:29.712 --> 00:10:31.005
The game continues

00:10:31.005 --> 00:10:36.344
and the next confession is read and turns out
glasses guy Tenji is lying about his age.

00:10:36.344 --> 00:10:40.097
He admits that the confession is a little harsh
but true, and reveals that only

00:10:40.097 --> 00:10:43.392
she should know about it since they were childhood
friends.

00:10:43.392 --> 00:10:47.730
The results are decided with Shiho
in first Tenji and second as of round six.

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:52.193
Shiho here is in first place with 18 spaces ahead
trashing the competition.

00:10:52.234 --> 00:10:56.489
That's when she hosts Steps on a special space
and is given a dangerous ability.

00:10:56.530 --> 00:11:00.409
She can pick anyone in the group
to have all of their secrets exposed,

00:11:00.409 --> 00:11:02.328
depending on how bad the secret is.

00:11:02.328 --> 00:11:05.247
The percentage of votes will determine
how many steps they take.

00:11:05.247 --> 00:11:09.877
She decides to choose Shibe, and the mascot
reveals that his lawyer father has been doing

00:11:09.877 --> 00:11:15.007
some nasty things after hours and has been
spending a lot of money to cover it all up.

00:11:15.049 --> 00:11:19.512
The votes are then decided and Shibe moves
into second place with 17 spaces.

00:11:19.512 --> 00:11:22.973
However, Yuichi here has something up his sleeve.

00:11:23.015 --> 00:11:27.186
He puts down a confession into the booth
that states Shibe has killed someone.

00:11:27.228 --> 00:11:32.149
They take a special vote, and 99% of the viewers
believe that Shibe is a killer.

00:11:32.149 --> 00:11:35.569
Now, Shibe is at first place with 22 spaces.

00:11:35.611 --> 00:11:39.031
Yuichi comforts him
and assures that his buddy isn't a murderer.

00:11:39.073 --> 00:11:43.244
He tells the group to stop fighting
among each other because there's only one bad egg.

00:11:43.244 --> 00:11:44.161
And this nest.

00:11:44.161 --> 00:11:46.330
And he knows exactly who it is.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:49.375
However, he's not ready to reveal who it is
just yet.

00:11:49.417 --> 00:11:53.337
Yuichi tells them
that the game is extremely suspicious and unfair.

00:11:53.379 --> 00:11:57.007
No matter what they do, they'll be penalized
and placed into even further debt.

00:11:57.007 --> 00:12:01.095
He reminds the group that round six
was the first time they were given a debt

00:12:01.095 --> 00:12:05.099
reduction and realizes
that there are both negative and positive spaces.

00:12:05.141 --> 00:12:09.186
The negative spaces were loaded at the front
to make the group lose trust in each other,

00:12:09.186 --> 00:12:14.567
while the positive spaces slowly increase in the
second half to reveal that teamwork is essential.

00:12:14.567 --> 00:12:17.945
Okay,
now we know that we've been tricked yet again.

00:12:17.945 --> 00:12:19.572
However, this is on us.

00:12:19.572 --> 00:12:22.491
The game is literally called the friends game.

00:12:22.491 --> 00:12:24.160
Everything here happens for a reason

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:27.705
and this is something to keep in mind
if we make it to game three.

00:12:27.747 --> 00:12:30.666
Whoever's controlling
this game has stacked the odds against us,

00:12:30.666 --> 00:12:33.794
and all we need to do is to think carefully
about our next step.

00:12:33.794 --> 00:12:37.465
Now, the hardest part of this game
is to trust our teammates.

00:12:37.465 --> 00:12:42.011
The messages flying above us are there for
the sole purpose of making us turn on each other.

00:12:42.011 --> 00:12:46.724
If I was Yuichi at this point, I'd let the game
play out as normal without any more planning.

00:12:46.766 --> 00:12:49.685
We know that the distrust within
the group is at an all time

00:12:49.685 --> 00:12:53.856
high, and there's not much you can do to influence
a bunch of hormonal teenagers.

00:12:53.856 --> 00:12:54.815
Let's be honest.

00:12:54.815 --> 00:12:55.733
But who knows?

00:12:55.733 --> 00:12:57.735
Maybe we can lose the game and ask.

00:12:57.735 --> 00:13:02.907
Shibe is evil lawyer father to put a few strings
out and let us off the hook with all of this debt.

00:13:02.948 --> 00:13:06.786
Shibe's dad, is pretty sleazy,
but Shibe is our best buddy.

00:13:06.786 --> 00:13:07.244
Right?

00:13:07.244 --> 00:13:10.998
And that means we could blackmail him
with the information we now have, of course.

00:13:10.998 --> 00:13:13.626
It's been broadcasted on live stream,
but we don't know

00:13:13.626 --> 00:13:18.088
who the hell is watching this shit
or how many viewers this illegal game even has.

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:22.551
The next round Manabu suddenly announces
that there were ten cards in the box.

00:13:22.593 --> 00:13:26.972
Tenji confronts Yuichi and tells them
that his plan was doomed to fail from the start.

00:13:27.014 --> 00:13:31.310
Suddenly, he reveals another way
to figure out who the traitor is once and for all.

00:13:31.352 --> 00:13:34.313
Since Shiho is going to reach the end regardless.

00:13:34.355 --> 00:13:36.607
He tells everyone to write down
the same confession.

00:13:36.607 --> 00:13:39.485
I'm the one who applied to the Tomodachi game.

00:13:39.527 --> 00:13:41.946
If they all write the same thing,
the traitor will be

00:13:41.946 --> 00:13:44.573
the only one who is not going to be penalized.

00:13:44.573 --> 00:13:49.286
But everyone but the traitor will be moved
to one space above Shiho, allowing everyone

00:13:49.286 --> 00:13:50.955
but the traitor to reach the goal.

00:13:50.955 --> 00:13:54.458
The group agrees on this idea
and they all hand in their confession papers.

00:13:54.458 --> 00:13:57.586
When the papers are read out,
though, only one reads the phrase.

00:13:57.586 --> 00:13:59.713
Yuichi mentioned. Tenji shocked.

00:13:59.713 --> 00:14:04.552
He breaks down on the spot and Yuichi demands
that this creepy glasses guy finally reveal

00:14:04.552 --> 00:14:07.638
if he was the one who applied for this evil debt
game.

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:12.059
The broken man finally admits that he did it
and the traitor has been uncovered.

00:14:12.059 --> 00:14:16.856
But suddenly, out of the blue, Manabu interrupts
to tell them all that Shiho is still going to be

00:14:16.856 --> 00:14:18.691
the only one moving on to Game three.

00:14:18.691 --> 00:14:23.445
But Yuichi whispers to the mascot
that he lied in round seven and broke the rules.

00:14:23.487 --> 00:14:28.617
Suddenly, Manabu announces that the game is over
and Yuichi is penalized by taking Chico's place.

00:14:28.617 --> 00:14:29.910
And he's about to leave.

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:35.666
But Tenji gets up and reveals that he also
told a lie and he joins Yuichi in the third game.

00:14:35.708 --> 00:14:39.670
The two wake up in a cave
and are told to stay in there for three days.

00:14:39.712 --> 00:14:44.258
Yuichi finds a single bottle of water
that is supposed to last them the entire time.

00:14:44.258 --> 00:14:45.968
Tenji reveals something shocking.

00:14:45.968 --> 00:14:48.888
This is his second time in the Tomodachi game.

00:14:48.929 --> 00:14:53.017
This kid is ¥20 million in debt
and shiho is the reason for all of it.

00:14:53.017 --> 00:14:55.352
Okay. What did I say about creepy glasses?

00:14:55.394 --> 00:15:01.483
Got energy, but false crazy revelations aside,
this situation is really, really, really bad.

00:15:01.483 --> 00:15:04.069
And we could die before this third game
even begins.

00:15:04.111 --> 00:15:07.114
The average person can only survive
without water for a few days.

00:15:07.114 --> 00:15:09.575
At most it wouldn't be so bad if it was just food.

00:15:09.575 --> 00:15:12.870
As we can survive for way longer without food.
But water.

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:14.955
Water is something we must have regularly.

00:15:14.955 --> 00:15:17.207
And we've been without water for at least a day.

00:15:17.249 --> 00:15:21.378
With the kidnaping and two previous games,
this situation is life and death.

00:15:21.378 --> 00:15:25.466
However, it's really not that bad
if we do a few simple key things.

00:15:25.466 --> 00:15:28.969
What I would do if I was them would be to take off
all of my clothes. Hear me out.

00:15:29.011 --> 00:15:33.807
Now I know it might be a bit awkward for the first
few hours, but any extra layers of clothing

00:15:33.807 --> 00:15:38.103
will make us sweat more and cause us to lose
precious resources within our body.

00:15:38.145 --> 00:15:42.316
This also goes hand in hand with doing
absolutely no physical activity.

00:15:42.316 --> 00:15:44.068
There's not much we can do inside a cave

00:15:44.068 --> 00:15:46.153
So making sure we don't move around too much

00:15:46.153 --> 00:15:50.741
or accidentally argue among ourselves
is the most important thing to our survival.

00:15:50.783 --> 00:15:53.827
Once that's settled,
we can focus on conserving the resources

00:15:53.827 --> 00:15:56.997
we do have in order to stay alive and sorta
healthy.

00:15:57.039 --> 00:15:57.706
We've been given

00:15:57.706 --> 00:16:02.086
a single bottle of water between the two of us,
which is not ideal for staying hydrated.

00:16:02.127 --> 00:16:06.465
The human body needs at least one and a half
liters of water to stay properly hydrated.

00:16:06.507 --> 00:16:07.967
Assuming this bottle is one

00:16:07.967 --> 00:16:12.763
and a half leaders, from the way it looks,
we have about 750 milliliters for each of us.

00:16:12.805 --> 00:16:13.889
It's not going to be pretty,

00:16:13.889 --> 00:16:17.935
but we can survive if we can serve our water
and to limit our physical activity.

00:16:17.935 --> 00:16:19.228
After three brutal

00:16:19.228 --> 00:16:23.983
days, the boys leave the cave to find themselves
in front of now Sergeant Manabu.

00:16:24.024 --> 00:16:29.738
The mascot introduces them to their enemy team
and the final game friendly hide and seek.

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:32.449
Both groups will choose one person
to hide in the forest

00:16:32.449 --> 00:16:35.035
and the seekers
will need to find the hidden enemy.

00:16:35.077 --> 00:16:39.415
However, the seekers can switch sides
if it looks like they're about to lose.

00:16:39.456 --> 00:16:44.628
Suddenly, Manabu tells the smaller group that one
other person and an entirely different team

00:16:44.628 --> 00:16:44.962
made it.

00:16:44.962 --> 00:16:49.717
Also to game three and if they want,
they can have this person join their team.

00:16:49.758 --> 00:16:55.222
Yuichi asks if it's a girl and Manabu says yes,
and Yuichi immediately accepts the offer.

00:16:55.222 --> 00:17:00.227
That's when this bombshell of a girl, Maria,
steps out and introduces herself to the others.

00:17:00.269 --> 00:17:02.688
Manabu continues with explaining the rules,

00:17:02.688 --> 00:17:07.276
telling them that violence is prohibited
against the other team and the hider cannot move.

00:17:07.276 --> 00:17:08.652
Once they picked a location.

00:17:08.652 --> 00:17:12.865
Surveillance cameras are all over the forest
to make sure they don't break the rules.

00:17:12.865 --> 00:17:16.577
They've been given phones that they can use
to contact either side if they want.

00:17:16.618 --> 00:17:20.247
And there's a big stash of food
exposed in the middle of the forest

00:17:20.247 --> 00:17:24.918
for anyone who's brave enough to go and get it
if they're willing to risk getting caught.

00:17:24.918 --> 00:17:27.046
Last but not least, the fighters are handed

00:17:27.046 --> 00:17:31.967
a give up grenade if they decide to call it
quits and end the game as the loser.

00:17:32.009 --> 00:17:32.426
Okay.

00:17:32.426 --> 00:17:37.598
If I were the boys, I'd be using our new teammate
as a complete guinea pig for our operation.

00:17:37.598 --> 00:17:39.850
Friendly hide and seek is a game of wits

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:44.063
and using the person who's not starving
is probably the better bet at winning the game.

00:17:44.063 --> 00:17:46.815
This is why this slim young Fang
is the perfect bait.

00:17:46.815 --> 00:17:51.028
She has no option but to take our advice
if she wants to continue playing anyways.

00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:52.613
While it's not going to sound pretty,

00:17:52.613 --> 00:17:55.741
we should do our best to convince her
that we're morally sound people

00:17:55.783 --> 00:18:00.454
just so we can take advantage of her abilities
when we get the chance by ourselves.

00:18:00.496 --> 00:18:04.249
We should ask
Manabu is violence against team mates prohibited?

00:18:04.249 --> 00:18:07.586
And if it isn't, that means we can do
whatever we want to this new recruit.

00:18:07.586 --> 00:18:08.420
If it were me,

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:12.591
I would have her appointed as the hider
and instantly snatch the give up grenade from her.

00:18:12.591 --> 00:18:13.425
We don't know her.

00:18:13.425 --> 00:18:14.426
We can't trust her.

00:18:14.426 --> 00:18:19.014
And also, this girl, while cute and adorable,
isn't really that innocent as she seems.

00:18:19.014 --> 00:18:21.225
No one in the Tomodachi game has made it here

00:18:21.225 --> 00:18:24.186
without stepping on a few toes
and breaking a few hearts.

00:18:24.186 --> 00:18:27.815
And she doesn't seem any different
with the give up grenade in our possession.

00:18:27.856 --> 00:18:29.775
We can tell her to hide wherever we please

00:18:29.775 --> 00:18:32.236
and know that the girl couldn't give up
if she wanted to.

00:18:32.236 --> 00:18:36.490
Then if we had to estimate that would give us
about three days to find the other hider

00:18:36.532 --> 00:18:39.910
before this girl goes crazy or dies
from lack of food and water.

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:42.121
But her sacrifice will be for our gain.

00:18:42.121 --> 00:18:42.704
Thank you.

00:18:42.704 --> 00:18:45.332
So it's about as far as you can get in anime.

00:18:45.332 --> 00:18:50.212
Anyways, Yuichi decides that Tenji is
going to hide in a small cave onto the cliffside,

00:18:50.212 --> 00:18:53.090
making sure that the new girl
doesn't know his location.

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:58.303
Three days past, and which he still hasn't
returned to give him food and water that night.

00:18:58.345 --> 00:19:01.807
Yuichi tells the opposing team
that he wants to switch sides.

00:19:01.849 --> 00:19:02.516
The enemy team

00:19:02.516 --> 00:19:07.396
decides to let him in and call their captain
to ask for permission to let him really join them.

00:19:07.396 --> 00:19:09.982
He tells them to not let Yuichi join their side.

00:19:09.982 --> 00:19:12.317
Instead, he asks the girl to change teams,

00:19:12.317 --> 00:19:17.573
but she decides to forget about changing teams,
knowing that he has a plan up his sleeve.

00:19:17.614 --> 00:19:19.283
The morning after half of the enemy

00:19:19.283 --> 00:19:23.328
team left to give their captain food,
Yuichi has a heart to heart conversation

00:19:23.412 --> 00:19:27.666
with a spiky haired blondie here,
trying to make him suspicious of his buddies.

00:19:27.708 --> 00:19:32.671
This brown haired kid interrupts to switch places
and Blondie walks over to Maria's bedside

00:19:32.671 --> 00:19:35.632
to find out that she's disappeared,
walking deeper into the forest.

00:19:35.674 --> 00:19:38.760
He finds the girl
cleaning herself up in her underwear,

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:41.847
and he freaks out and runs back to tell his buddy
what just happened.

00:19:41.847 --> 00:19:45.017
But that's when Yuichi steals the food rations
and runs off.

00:19:45.058 --> 00:19:48.937
The enemy team chases after them,
and he decides to do something crazy. You eat.

00:19:48.937 --> 00:19:53.317
He pushes the new girl off of the cliff side
and she starts to fall to her death.

00:19:53.317 --> 00:19:56.987
But Blondie jumps in in the nick of time
to save her from dying.

00:19:57.070 --> 00:20:01.158
Yuichi then arrives at the cave and rushes in
to save Tenji from near death.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:05.662
He explains that he was analyzing the team
for the last few days and pushed Maria off

00:20:05.662 --> 00:20:08.540
the cliff
like a madman to use her as a distraction.

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:12.836
The seekers meet back up at the food ration
location where tensions are high as hell.

00:20:12.836 --> 00:20:16.882
Yuichi eggs the enemy team
on causing the blind guy to become violent,

00:20:16.882 --> 00:20:21.887
but that's when he realizes that he can use
blonde guy's to crush on Maria as a path to victory.

00:20:21.887 --> 00:20:26.558
Suddenly, the blond guy requests
to move to Yuichi team and is instantly approved.

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:31.855
That night, the new team member is tied up
and Maria here pretends to fear for his safety.

00:20:31.897 --> 00:20:34.191
She tries to find out
more about the enemy captain,

00:20:34.191 --> 00:20:37.945
but he reveals that his old captain
didn't even tell them where he was hiding.

00:20:37.945 --> 00:20:38.487
Shocked.

00:20:38.487 --> 00:20:41.865
Yuichi questions
how he never found out the captain's location,

00:20:41.865 --> 00:20:46.954
but then bowl cut hair, calls him and reveals
to Yuichi that he was the captain all along

00:20:46.954 --> 00:20:51.166
and tells them that the blond kid is a liability
and resorts to violence easily.

00:20:51.208 --> 00:20:53.669
Okay, this might not have been the best idea.

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:58.048
The blond kid is a hot headed individual
and that means we can easily lose this game

00:20:58.048 --> 00:20:59.591
by way of disqualification.

00:20:59.591 --> 00:21:04.263
However, we can use this to our advantage and
figure out a way to win through the same method.

00:21:04.263 --> 00:21:06.890
Using mental mind
games has been the key to our success

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:10.185
throughout all three games,
and this one isn't any different.

00:21:10.185 --> 00:21:11.186
If I was Yuichi,

00:21:11.186 --> 00:21:15.691
I would tie the kid up as soon as possible,
and luckily the kid is firmly tied to this tree.

00:21:15.732 --> 00:21:18.235
I would start by gathering
all the personal information

00:21:18.235 --> 00:21:21.154
I can about his ex-teammates
and use that as a weapon.

00:21:21.196 --> 00:21:24.574
With this knowledge,
I could leak out juicy details to the enemy team

00:21:24.574 --> 00:21:29.871
and try to rile them up enough so that him and his
now opposing team get into a fight.

00:21:29.871 --> 00:21:33.834
Because remember, violence
against the opposing team is strictly prohibited

00:21:33.834 --> 00:21:37.963
and would instantly disqualify them
if they're stupid enough to get violent.

00:21:38.005 --> 00:21:41.633
The next day the enemy team shows up
and tells them to stay put.

00:21:41.675 --> 00:21:45.679
Maria tells them that she's going for a toilet
break and runs into Bowl cut Kid.

00:21:45.679 --> 00:21:48.140
He confronts her about being planted by the game

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:53.270
masters and demands that she betray Yuichi
by giving her an offer that she cannot refuse.

00:21:53.312 --> 00:21:56.898
Moments later, she calls her teammate
to ask about Tenji's hiding spot.

00:21:56.898 --> 00:22:00.652
Suddenly, Yuichi spots her revealing
all their information to the enemy team.

00:22:00.694 --> 00:22:05.324
The bowl cut kid calls Tenji and tells him
that Yuichi is willing to let his teammate die

00:22:05.324 --> 00:22:06.908
if it gives him the win.

00:22:06.908 --> 00:22:10.996
She screams out that he's lying and the new
captain reveals that he's right above him.

00:22:11.038 --> 00:22:14.166
Manabu orders everyone to meet up
so he can announce the winner.

00:22:14.207 --> 00:22:17.127
The winner of the third
and final game is a witch's group.

00:22:17.169 --> 00:22:22.591
Everyone is shocked and the fake captain admits
that he pressed the button before the game ended.

00:22:22.632 --> 00:22:24.426
Yuichi came up with a genius plan.

00:22:24.426 --> 00:22:25.427
He called the fake

00:22:25.427 --> 00:22:29.431
captain and threatened to break his buddies
fingers if he didn't give up with that.

00:22:29.431 --> 00:22:32.309
The group wins ¥2 million
and the third game is over.

00:22:32.309 --> 00:22:36.730
However, they're going to realize
that the Tomodachi game isn't over just yet.

00:22:36.772 --> 00:22:41.026
The boys decide to head straight to school
and find Shiho entering the classroom.

00:22:41.026 --> 00:22:44.905
They see their old teammate, Yutori,
who tells them that the others have disappeared.

00:22:44.905 --> 00:22:47.407
She tells them that the confessions from
the second game

00:22:47.407 --> 00:22:51.578
were broadcasted to the entire world
and Shibe's father is in big trouble.

00:22:51.620 --> 00:22:54.915
That night, the boys discuss
what to do about the current situation.

00:22:54.915 --> 00:22:59.002
A mystery number calls Tenji and asks
if his genius buddy is with him.

00:22:59.044 --> 00:23:01.004
The caller displays a photo of Yutori.

00:23:01.004 --> 00:23:06.051
Tied up and tells them to meet him in an
abandoned warehouse or she'll be seriously hurt.

00:23:06.093 --> 00:23:07.344
Okay. No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:23:07.344 --> 00:23:10.972
I say skip that the best way of
going about this situation would be to leave her.

00:23:10.972 --> 00:23:14.768
But with the sharks, everyone in our group
seems to be a damn evil piece of crap.

00:23:14.768 --> 00:23:17.854
And this game is causing us more trouble
than we could have ever imagined.

00:23:17.854 --> 00:23:19.564
If I were the boys, I'd call it a day.

00:23:19.564 --> 00:23:22.067
We've just been through
three grueling games together

00:23:22.067 --> 00:23:24.653
and had the hardest route
through the game compared to others.

00:23:24.653 --> 00:23:26.655
It's not our job to be the local police

00:23:26.655 --> 00:23:30.951
and we should probably just go back to school
and hit the books like a normal Japanese teenager.

00:23:30.992 --> 00:23:32.786
That being said, though, nearly

00:23:32.786 --> 00:23:37.666
100 children have been kidnaped from 2021
to 2022 in the country of Japan.

00:23:37.707 --> 00:23:40.877
These crimes have been increasing
at a constant rate, and the police

00:23:40.877 --> 00:23:44.047
should be aware that a high school student
has gone completely missing.

00:23:44.089 --> 00:23:47.509
We should agree to come to wherever
this mysterious person wants to take us.

00:23:47.509 --> 00:23:51.221
Once he gives us the location. Well, then
call the police and tell them where they're at.

00:23:51.263 --> 00:23:52.722
It's a win win situation.

00:23:52.722 --> 00:23:54.182
We don't have to get our hands dirty

00:23:54.182 --> 00:23:58.353
and potentially risk our lives
for the slim chance of success and the police

00:23:58.353 --> 00:24:01.898
won't be knocking on our doors
if we end up getting jittery here killed.

00:24:01.940 --> 00:24:06.695
Yuichi arrives at the destined location,
only to be confronted by a group of thugs.

00:24:06.736 --> 00:24:08.238
This white haired man, Kuroki,

00:24:08.238 --> 00:24:12.951
introduces himself as the emcee of the next game,
the weak will game.

00:24:12.993 --> 00:24:18.123
Yuichi here isn't allowed to talk or move and
will be forced to go through three rounds of pain

00:24:18.165 --> 00:24:21.418
if he can pass them
all. He'll let him and Yutori go free.

00:24:21.460 --> 00:24:25.213
However, the battery here
can volunteer to take some of the damage as well.

00:24:25.255 --> 00:24:29.843
If she's feeling oh so noble, Kuroki introduces
this massive beefcake

00:24:29.843 --> 00:24:35.307
bodybuilder friend and gives the option for Yuichi
to take three hits or four uteri to take one.

00:24:35.390 --> 00:24:39.269
She doesn't say anything in time,
and the punishment automatically goes to Yuichi.

00:24:39.311 --> 00:24:44.274
The MC introduces the next round called
Fingernail Removal and gives them two options.

00:24:44.274 --> 00:24:48.403
Once again, Yutori can have one fingernail removed
or Yuichi can have three

00:24:48.403 --> 00:24:52.866
ripped off, and Yuichi steps up to the challenge
and is given the brutal punishment.

00:24:52.908 --> 00:24:56.119
The third and final round is the most sadistic
one yet.

00:24:56.161 --> 00:24:59.289
The Yutori has the option
of exotically stripping down

00:24:59.289 --> 00:25:03.710
and being ogled at by all the guys, or
Yuichi can have his hand gouged out.

00:25:03.710 --> 00:25:09.341
Instead, he decides to take the punishment
and has his hand brutally disfigured by the MC.

00:25:09.341 --> 00:25:14.554
Yutori begs for forgiveness and apologizes for not
taking any of the pain and patches up his hand.

00:25:14.596 --> 00:25:19.100
He forgives the girl and turns over to the M.C.,
offering to play one final game rock,

00:25:19.100 --> 00:25:20.393
paper, scissors.

00:25:20.393 --> 00:25:24.064
If Kuroki wins,
Yuichi will hand over ¥10 million in cash.

00:25:24.064 --> 00:25:28.276
But if he loses, Yuichi gets to cut off
a certain number of fingers, depending

00:25:28.276 --> 00:25:29.611
on which hand he threw.

00:25:29.611 --> 00:25:31.154
He convinces Kuroki's lackey

00:25:31.154 --> 00:25:35.784
to agree with this offer by handing out 1 million
to each person if their leader wins.

00:25:35.825 --> 00:25:39.955
Not only that, with his wrapped up hand,
which he can only throw rock or paper

00:25:39.955 --> 00:25:44.209
on the count of three they throw down
and the MSI realizes he made a big mistake.

00:25:44.209 --> 00:25:47.671
Yuichi throws scissors with his other hand
and wins the game.

00:25:47.754 --> 00:25:52.384
Okay, that was a total clutch move
and technically means that he wins him the game.

00:25:52.425 --> 00:25:54.886
We're not exactly dealing with morally sound
people here.

00:25:54.886 --> 00:25:57.138
These guys are thugs through and through, meaning

00:25:57.138 --> 00:25:59.182
they're ready to do
whatever it takes to get at us.

00:25:59.224 --> 00:26:03.353
They've already kidnaped our friend here,
so there's likely no way they won't cross the line

00:26:03.353 --> 00:26:04.563
when it comes to harming us.

00:26:04.563 --> 00:26:07.816
However, the key word is us
and a life or death situation.

00:26:07.857 --> 00:26:10.318
There's only one person I care about,
and that's myself.

00:26:10.360 --> 00:26:13.113
While we might have convinced his lackeys
to exert later on

00:26:13.113 --> 00:26:15.865
and play my game,
there's no telling what the reaction could be.

00:26:15.865 --> 00:26:20.370
Once I win through semi alleged cheating
just because it makes sense in a technical way.

00:26:20.412 --> 00:26:24.541
It doesn't mean these thugs won't just technically
beat my ass for trying to pull a fast one.

00:26:24.583 --> 00:26:27.168
There's nothing stopping us
from leaving this dirty warehouse

00:26:27.168 --> 00:26:29.087
and our ragtag group of friends behind.

00:26:29.087 --> 00:26:31.464
We will be living stress
free for the rest of our lives

00:26:31.464 --> 00:26:34.884
and get out of this shithole
with a few little bumps and bruises.

00:26:34.926 --> 00:26:38.722
Furious Kuroki tells his thugs to grab the kid
and teach him a lesson.

00:26:38.722 --> 00:26:43.184
That's when the Tomodachi Game Management
bursts inside and restrains all of the thugs.

00:26:43.226 --> 00:26:44.603
The managers tell Kuroki

00:26:44.603 --> 00:26:49.941
that he's in trouble for impersonating Manabu,
but Yuichi here isn't done with him yet.

00:26:49.941 --> 00:26:54.779
He tells the managers to lay off for a second
and says that he must collect his prize and gives

00:26:54.779 --> 00:26:58.074
Kuroki an option
for which fingers he wants to cut off.

00:26:58.074 --> 00:27:02.912
Suddenly he passes out on the spot and the
managers take him away for emergency medical aid.

00:27:02.954 --> 00:27:06.166
They're not going to let their best product die
this easily.

00:27:06.166 --> 00:27:10.879
The new girl, Maria, offers the remaining
participants a brand new game to save Shibe.

00:27:10.920 --> 00:27:14.924
However, if they lose, they'll be given
¥500 million in debt.

00:27:14.924 --> 00:27:17.719
Yuichi wakes up to encourage the others
to keep on going.

00:27:17.761 --> 00:27:20.930
All the while,
he chills in the hospital scot free.

